(text "Two separate complete anti-series switches are CASCADED, not two independent safety channels. Stage A Q804 Q805 Q806, Stage B Q814 Q815 Q816, external enables only; common GND and unknown floating source, no qualification. Q804 Q805 Q806 LAB ONLY. ENABLE_LOGIC_5V_LAB requires FUTURE INDEPENDENT qualified power-good. Q806 E1 B2 C3, R2103 4k7, R2104 100k OFF bias; KSP42BU candidate VCEO300V exceeds static 48V envelope, but no transient qualification. D2101 D2102 Microchip 1N4106-1 DO-35 THT low-current OEM candidate Vz at 250uA. 250uA data not global VGS proof. Dual OPEN and common driver faults remain. NO FAB. NO FAB / NO TX / NO BATTERIA / NO VEICOLO." (at 200.66 271.78 0)(effects (font (size 1 1)))(uuid "e202dc05-0000-4000-8000-000000000025"))
